      "title": "minimax h3 reference edit",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "MCP image preset: minimax_h3_reference_edit\n\nSelect your own image in each LoadImage node. The supplied mug is a generated example. Change prompt and dimensions before running. Saved images go to the ComfyUI output folder. Seed is fixed for repeatable comparisons.\n\nExperimental H3 still adaptation: installed ref2va model, 20 steps, res_multistep/simple. Generates 5 frames and saves only frame 0. RGB output. BasicGuider has no CFG or negative prompt. Use <Picture 1>, <Picture 2>, etc. in connected order. Width/height: multiples of 32. Audio VAE and custom speed nodes are unnecessary. This is not the missing hybrid/Turbo model from the original reference file. Start with 1024x768; 5 frames are below the trained video duration."
      ]
    }
